Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:39.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,《疯狂的麦克斯》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:02.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正义厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:06.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（离现今不久后的未来…）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（基地巡逻队）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:03.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拦截车）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.87,0:38:56.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蜜糖镇酒店）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.68,0:46:54.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣乔治医院）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.84,0:55:52.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你撞烂车 我们修车）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.75,1:22:03.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（停 禁区）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是例行追缉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a routine pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地回复 这是例行追缉 代码44\N{\fnArial\fs30}Main Force repeats, this is a routine pursuit. Code 44.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们 我们需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you tell them we need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该是公开代码的闪电行动 你是知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should be an open-code blitz, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已有足够信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your information.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 亲爱的 这是条大鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sweetheart, this one's a heavyweight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地回复 你们已掌握信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Main Force repeats, you have your information.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是例行追缉 请向大巴普通报\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a routine pursuit. Please report to Big Bopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,三月兔呼叫大巴普 请求援助 代码3 红色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}March Hare to Big Bopper. Assist on Code 3 red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.90,0:01:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,三月 兔呼叫大巴普…\N{\fnArial\fs30}March Hare to Big Bopper. March Hare to Big Bopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大巴普 收到了 三月兔 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big Bopper. Gotcha, Hare. What's going down?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们发现一个警察杀手 - 没开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've got a cop-killer. - You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.22,0:01:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你了 塞斯 这是违抗命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be warned, Sarse, this is non-compliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地不会容忍这样的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Main Force will not tolerate such action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是3号红色警报 这场追缉被指定为代码44\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a Code 3 red alert. This pursuit is designated a standard Code 44.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要向其他代码作出回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please respond only to that code.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,代码44说明不必封锁道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code 44 indicates no requirement for a blockade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆追缉专用车被偷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Pursuit Special has been stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,市府大队长费贾麦卡菲 比你还讨厌这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hall Captain Fifi Macaffee does not like this any more than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而我们不能在领土方面妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, we must not compromise territorial range.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.33,0:02:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 唯有遵循指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that only by following instructions…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.34,0:02:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才有希望维持一个规范的公路秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}…can we hope to maintain a successful highway program.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,三月兔呼叫大巴普 我们三分钟后到路口\N{\fnArial\fs30}March Hare to Big Bopper. We're three minutes off the intersection.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们赶得到吗？- 我们能赶到 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reckon you can make it? - We'll make it! Move over!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.01,0:02:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗普 - 由我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roop! - I'm driving!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不行 我才是这次行动的受指派者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this again! I've been assigned!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 应该由我开车才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, you son of a bitch. I'm supposed to drive this heap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.64,0:02:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才给我等等 我已经忍无可忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you get off, huh? Where do you get off?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞斯 这家伙长什么模样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sarse, what's the form on this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个古怪的机车骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A weirdo bike jockey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时前在太阳城被发现 他像疯了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few hours ago, down in Sun City, he goes berserk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,挣脕拘捕 杀了个年轻员警 开着追缉专用车逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaks custody, wastes a rookie and takes off in a Pursuit Special.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在追他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been on him ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人发疯了 罗普\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's as flaky as they come, Roop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过那种风格 严重精神病患\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen the style before. It's terminal psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他驾驶什么车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是最要命的 我们的V8之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what hurts. It's one of our V8s.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用甲烷的追缉专用车 性能很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pursuit Special on methane. Super hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离无政府之路只有半里路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're about half a mile off Anarchy Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随时会看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see him any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要将他开肠剖肚 给他好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip the guts out of him! Give it to me, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See him yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要轰掉他 - 可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna blow him away! - Goddamn him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.51,0:03:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要撞死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ram him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离乘客座位的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move away from the passenger door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要撞死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ram him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你们还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fellas, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到请回答 大巴普 收到请回答 你们还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acknowledge, Big Bopper. Acknowledge, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗普？查理？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roop? Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到我没 斩脚趾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see me, Toecutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到我的厉害没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see me, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续追… 我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going. Keep going, we're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我们继续去追\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got you, we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生来手握方向盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born with a steering wheel in his hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚踩油门\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and lead in his foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Nightrider…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,以吓死人的速度狂飘\N{\fnArial\fs30}…cruising at the speed of fright!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夜骑士 我勇往直前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Nightrider, and I ain't never coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是喷射燃油的自杀机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fuel-injected suicide machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了么 你们这帮猪脑子 听见了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me, pigs? Do you hear me, Bronze pigs? Do you hear me, Bronze?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们还能动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're still mobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天杀的 滚过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Christ's sake, shove over!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又在出口成脏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're blaspheming again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不跟没素质的人合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to work with a blasphemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们跟丢了 猪脑子 嘿 大个子 我是夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you missed us, pig! Hey, big brother, this is The Nightrider…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大巴普呼叫三月兔 我们还在追 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big Bopper to March Hare. We're still in the game, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人渣和他的小贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Scag and his floozie…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,代码44 标准追缉 请回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code 44, standard pursuit. Please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地巡逻队呼叫小鹅一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}MFP to Gosling One.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地呼叫小鹅一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Goose, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就像慢动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like slow motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从座位上弹起来 撞破挡风玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He leaves his seat and goes through the windshield…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接撞上树 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…headfirst straight into the tree, right…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后从挡风玻璃弹回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then bounces back through the windshield.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们来到他那里时 他只是坐在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the time we got to him, he was just sitting there…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,脸皮都给撕烂了 还想嚷嚷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…trying to scream with his face ripped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hungry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿过来 我告诉你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it here. I'll tell you what…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他们朝人群冲过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, they're heading for population!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你跟强纳森 到底是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what's this I hear about you and Jonathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.59,0:07:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 强纳森怎样？- 有人两晚前看到你跟他出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about him? - You were seen with him two nights ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝这方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次真的死定了 他刚才是开了转弯灯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really gonna get it this time. He had his indicator on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能再开了 别上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you're not going on. Stay off the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然要开 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I'm going on. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经威胁到人民群众的生命安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}People's lives are in peril!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道不知道你在干嘛 你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? You gone nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要逮到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay off the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.57,0:08:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我发现他了 闭嘴… - 继续盯着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got him! Shut up! - Stay on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好惊险 - 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great! Down in one. - Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am ready for your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我也是刚到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. I just got here myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地巡逻队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Main Force Patrol…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们玩完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we're out of the game…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法继续追缉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…unable to continue pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好派运肉卡车来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better send a meat truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理伤得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie's been hurt bad in the throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到吗 麦克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me, Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全乱成一团\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are 100 percent snafued.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Goose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到热带地区过一年 什么都能好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing a year in the tropics wouldn't fix!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,损坏严重吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该来看看情况 条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see the damage, Bronze! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,金属损坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metal damage…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑部损坏 你在听吗 条子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…brain damage, huh? You listening, Bronze?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Nightrider!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是喷射燃油的自杀机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fuel-injected suicide machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又摇又滚 完全失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a rocker! I am a roller! I am an out-of-controller!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夜骑士 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a Nightrider, baby…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:10:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的马马杜 一往无前 永不言败\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it's me and my Marmaduke, and we ain't never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,斩脚趾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Toecutter…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he knows who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Nightrider!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是救世主 强大的复仇之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the chosen one, the mighty hand of vengeance…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,降临世界 打击那些不值得上路的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…sent down to strike the unroadworthy! Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比滚动的骰子更火热\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hotter than a rolling dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上前来 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step right up, chum…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and watch the kid…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,开出通往自由的一条橡胶大道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…lay down a rubber road, right to freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里不对劲？宝贝 哪里不对劲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? Baby, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.81,0:11:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,完蛋了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不剩 完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be nothing left. It's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了三天 那感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}After three days that feels so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上我一记右钩拳打在他脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a right hook in the mouth this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小不点？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sprog? - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他无论什么时候都要注意防左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him to always lead with his left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们的手中都有怪物附体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think we've got a monster on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 都是跟他老爹学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, takes after his old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.55,0:13:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙塔赞诺 他自称夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Montazano, who called himself the Nightrider…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.93,0:13:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,从拘留所劫持一辆警车后逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}…had broken from custody and escaped to the police vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.30,0:13:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你又上新闻了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You made the news again. Hm. - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是另一个光荣骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another glory roader, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.15,0:14:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,洁西 我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessie, I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.13,0:14:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大鹅想要我早点到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Goose wants me there early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没说是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for, he didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道大鹅这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the Goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.97,0:14:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡煮好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在生闷气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not grumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}0kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你痴狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于肇事者的处罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penalties against pirate towing-operators…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会在下一季加强\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will be stiffened considerably in the next quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对肇事者拘留将会改为直接没收其装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driver detention will be replaced by rig confiscation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此新法令下的二次犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second offenders under the new decree…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,将与州汽车主管单位见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will be met by state appropriation of the unauthorized vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,备忘录第三条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memorandum Three:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:02.25,Title,0,0,0,0,,最近在《人民公报》报导的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The incidents have been reported recently in the People's Gazette.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在基地成员之间 将不允许出现燃料买卖现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is to be no dealing in petroleum by members of the Main Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,备忘录第七条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memorandum Seven:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,市府大队长们要求追缉警员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Captains of the Hall have asked that pursuit officers…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在基地追缉队时 避免使用「条子」这样的俚语\N{\fnArial\fs30}…refrain from using the slang "Bronze" for the Main Force Patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一词有不敬意味\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word is considered disrespectful…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,应主动劝阻市民使用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and citizens should actively be discouraged from its use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那家伙的锐气杀光了 巴瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick it in the guts, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.78,0:16:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是剩下的最后一辆V8\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the last of the V8s.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.62,0:16:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会爱死这辆 她实在是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can shut the gate on this one. It's the Duck's guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她是我们最后一辆V8了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she's the last of the V8s.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,硝化甘油动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucks nitro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,四向变速 双重顶置凸轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phase 4, head, twin overhead cam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他说说这个蜗轮 600匹马力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him about the Blower. Six hundred horsepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是会唱歌的霸王 这车生来就要奔驰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Blower! The Blower, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他被迷住 了 - 他喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's in a coma, man! - He loves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}0kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是怎么组装出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did you get all this together?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你看见的一样 麦克斯 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just happened, Max, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里凑一凑 那里拼一拼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A piece from here and a piece from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这么简单？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So easy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 麦克斯 你看过车 听过车发动 还要问问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Max. You've seen it, you've heard it, and you're still asking questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,武士码1 多重致命进度46…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code Samurai 1, progress 46 on multiple fatal. Code Samurai 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们何时去兜风？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do we go for a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.31,0:17:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.98,0:17:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的第一追击手想不干了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your top pursuit man wants to quit the road…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得拿甜头来引诱他回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we have to seduce him with candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们对英雄己不抱信心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't believe in heroes anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 麦卡菲 你想把英雄还给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Macaffee. You want to give them back their heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这招对我不再管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not try this one on me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢浪费钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not enjoy wasting money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 拉巴吐什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Labatouche…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're a real human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 给我滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个老机器今晚又开工了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old meat grinder's humming tonight, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 麦克斯刚搞定一对疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Max took out a couple of crazies just now, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴行不行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 又有了一次光辉记录了吧 你吃过没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Max, another one for your books, eh? You eaten yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:19:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 还没 我待会再买点束西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not yet. I'll pick up something later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你前几天去追缉的3号状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that, urn, Code 3 you ran down a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夜骑士？- 夜骑士 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Nightrider? - The Nightrider, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有问题 - 什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got a problem. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的朋友 听说他们想出动对付你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, his friends. Word is they're out to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 机车骑士？- 对 游手好闲的垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scoot jockeys? - Yeah, nomad trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会加在我的恐吓名单里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Well, I'll add it to my threat collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好小子 麦克斯 你是好小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, ha. Good boy, Max. You're a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里见一位朋友 他坐火车来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to meet a friend. Coming on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.11,0:21:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人下火车 只有几箱束西和…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing coming on the train except a couple of crates and a, heh…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一具棺材\N{\fnArial\fs30}…coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去找经手人 签署文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to see the agent and sign the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪能找到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we find…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个代理人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面应该是你们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be your friend over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他太嚣张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't leave much of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该把他的心挖出来，对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have cut his heart out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我就这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.95,0:22:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.95,0:22:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nightrider…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.06,0:22:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫这名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that is his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.25,0:22:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nightrider.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nightrider.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.02,0:22:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住他的名字…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember him…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你仰望夜空的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when you look at the night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.44,0:22:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的帽子摘下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your hat off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:22:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,全听你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.75,0:23:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,全听我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能保持如此的冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a wonderful philosophy you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.84,0:23:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.56,0:23:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,布巴 强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bubba.Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.64,0:24:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.27,0:24:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.69,0:24:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你逼我 我就干掉你 - 是吗？谁说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Push me, shove you! - Oh, yeah? Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.65,0:24:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你逼我 我就干掉你 - 是吗？谁说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Push me, shove you! - Oh, yeah? Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.69,0:24:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逼我 我就干掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push me, shove you, push me, shove you, push me, shove you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.54,0:24:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Nightrider!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.26,0:24:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightrider!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.97,0:25:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.13,0:27:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我叫吉姆大鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, my name is Jim Goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.09,0:27:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是洛卡谭斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rockatansky, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.76,0:27:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,威耶路撒冷有案件发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have incident at Wee Jerusalem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.88,0:27:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,游荡的机车骑士 大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nomad bikers, bulk trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.05,0:27:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们去处理 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're on it. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.83,0:27:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,大鹅 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goose, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.42,0:27:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long. Sorry, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.65,0:27:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.28,0:27:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不必坐牢的兔死金牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a get-out-of-jail-free card.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.67,0:27:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有其他细节吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any more details? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.67,0:28:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.55,0:28:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克斯 看到没？- 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Max, see what I see? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.60,0:28:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老兄 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fella, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.97,0:28:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fella!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.73,0:28:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.72,0:28:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老兄 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fella, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.65,0:28:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是大笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a turkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.15,0:28:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你就是个笨蛋 你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fella, you're a turkey, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.29,0:28:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来再收拾他 前面有大事要办\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll come back for him later. There's more up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.79,0:28:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightrider.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.58,0:28:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightrider.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.74,0:29:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}See to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.62,0:29:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bronze!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.79,0:29:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会逮到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.50,0:29:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}0kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.58,0:29:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 没人会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. No one's gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.13,0:29:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.72,0:29:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's whacked out of his skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.25,0:29:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whacked right out of his skull, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.01,0:29:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't never coming back. Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.11,0:29:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.98,0:29:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.94,0:29:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在会放掉绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna let this go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.62,0:29:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很害怕 女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're a frightened girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.99,0:29:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是再也不会有人伤害你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but no one's gonna hurt you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.62,0:29:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫吉姆大鹅 现在一切都没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Jim Goose, and everything's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.67,0:30:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,费费希望太阳城的事件不会再发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifi wants no recurrence of the Sun City incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.01,0:30:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告人们别挡路 用你的警笛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warn people off the roads. Use your sirens.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.77,0:30:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nightrider!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.12,0:30:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉姆 - 怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Jimbo. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.40,0:30:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得3号代码吗？- 当然记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember that Code 3? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.79,0:30:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你看着夜空时要想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember him when you look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.30,0:30:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you look…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.45,0:30:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightrider!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.74,0:30:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Well, Well!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.48,0:31:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼小子又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny the Boy is still at the wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.66,0:31:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stoned again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.23,0:31:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来不知道吸取教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never gonna learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.32,0:31:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们要好好教训他 布巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are going to teach him, Bubba.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.41,0:31:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要回去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going back for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.20,0:31:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不要 我不去 不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way! Not me, not for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.96,0:31:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不是为了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.02,0:31:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了我 布巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for me, Bubba.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.67,0:31:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费时间 那废物什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting your time! The Scag don't rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.87,0:31:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟夜骑士比起来不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's nothing like the Nightrider!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.17,0:32:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地巡逻队 代码1\N{\fnArial\fs30}MFP Code 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.49,0:32:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡菲大队长率领车队 正从法院前往正义厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Macaffee in convoy from the court house to the Halls of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.79,0:32:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.37,0:32:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆车怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.70,0:32:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.41,0:32:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像被嚼过又吐出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it was chewed up and spat out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.99,0:32:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许那是焦虑造成的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it was the result of anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.00,0:32:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 罗普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Roop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.59,0:32:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.90,0:32:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来 查理 我们时间多得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time, Charlie. We got plenty of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.83,0:33:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得到拦截车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see the Interceptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.87,0:33:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 人渣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, Scag?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.82,0:33:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的地方去了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got no place special to go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.47,0:33:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好给他准备一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better prep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.80,0:33:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,人渣 你带了牙刷来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scag, did you bring your toothbrush?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.25,0:33:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须帮大鹅代班 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll have to sit on the Goose. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.58,0:33:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不必多问 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No contest. - Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.69,0:33:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,老费 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Fif! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.49,0:33:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事？- 放他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.09,0:33:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 「放他走」 是什么意思？这是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he mean, "Let him go"? Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.07,0:33:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别插手 - 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep out of this. - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.82,0:33:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人出现 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one showed, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.36,0:33:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 查理 放他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it, Charlie. Just let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.61,0:34:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人指认 没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one showed. No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.33,0:34:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 「没人指认」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he mean, "No one showed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.52,0:34:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有指认罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.04,0:34:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人 阿飞没有指认犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody! The punks didn't show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩没有 整个镇上的人都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl didn't show, the townspeople didn't show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.65,0:34:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人指认罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody showed!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.50,0:34:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们被耍了 - 别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're screwed! - Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.17,0:34:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说没有人来指认是什么意思？你去了哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "No one showed"? Where were you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.88,0:34:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是 老家伙 你的案子不成立 别多问\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means, old man, you haven't got a case. No contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.22,0:34:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你不会这样让他走人吧 费费？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ! You're not gonna let him walk out the door, Fifi?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.55,0:34:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what you'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.09,0:34:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 继续 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, Ralphie! - Keep going, Charlie! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.65,0:34:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 条子 看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bronze, look at you…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.85,0:34:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,又聋又哑的废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a cripple and a mute!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.49,0:34:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他唱歌 我跳踢踏舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sings, and I tap-dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.57,0:34:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你是什么人 你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know what you are? You are, you're a…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.91,0:34:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,法院会知道这一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The courts will hear about this, I promise you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.59,0:34:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}The courts will hear about this disgrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.42,0:34:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个人令人反感到作呕 - 少挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This man is grossly offensive! - Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.88,0:34:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他赶出去 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of here, Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.21,0:34:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能使这个案子成立 - 我们不可能对一种抱怨立案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can make a case of it! - No one filed a complaint!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.38,0:34:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见他怎么对待那女孩的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what they did to that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.22,0:34:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天帮忙 她像机车一样被人骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, she was the town pump!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.14,0:35:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的犯人 我不让他走出这扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my prisoner, and he's not walking out that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.39,0:35:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他给我弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.77,0:35:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.98,0:35:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大鹅 冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goose, settle down, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.73,0:35:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.40,0:35:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 他们在嘲笑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, they're laughing at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.57,0:35:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看不出他们在嘲笑我们？我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see they're laughing at us? I don't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.62,0:35:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿见 大鹅 真是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, Goose. It's been a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.11,0:35:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 回家 我们不需要你在这里出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car, go home. We don't want you around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.90,0:36:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Goose!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.66,0:36:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对此无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do anything about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.76,0:36:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你是谁 条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know who you are, Bronze!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.16,0:36:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们公路上见 垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see you on the road, Scag!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.58,0:36:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,公路上见 就像夜骑士的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you on the road, like we saw the Nightrider!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.29,0:36:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们记得夜骑士 也知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We remember the Nightrider, and we know who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.59,0:36:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}0kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.26,0:36:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要所有文书处理干净 你们就可以为所欲为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long as the paperwork is clean, you boys can do what you like out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.31,0:36:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了 这个骚狐狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he is, the walking armpit! Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.45,0:36:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肚子里有团火 只有她这女人能平息\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a fire in my belly, and she's the woman to put it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.65,0:36:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,少碰她 禽兽 这天使是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off, brute, this angel's hot in the tubes for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.58,0:36:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yee-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.67,0:36:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欲火焚身…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.96,0:37:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,装疯卖傻是小孩的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joviality is a game of children.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.59,0:37:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的 我这双手应该去当外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mine. I should have been a surgeon with these hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.31,0:37:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒鬼 滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mudguts, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.65,0:37:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,康迪里尼 把她靠在柱子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cundalini, put her against the post.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.74,0:37:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.53,0:37:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可不想表面看起来那么安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is not what she seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.79,0:37:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,布巴赞内提有可靠消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bubba Zanetti has it on good authority…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.67,0:37:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是条子送她来的 一肚子坏水\N{\fnArial\fs30}…she's sent by the Bronze, full of treachery.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.01,0:37:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,条子夺走我们的自尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bronze kill our pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.31,0:38:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如想干掉条子 就必须做大一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're going to waste the Bronze, you gotta do it big!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.90,0:38:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没那种格调 是不是 屎蛋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't have the style, do you, chicken shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.53,0:38:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了一个假人下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes to water on a dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.04,0:38:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题的 你会有机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, you'll get your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.13,0:38:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.76,0:38:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 没事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Hm? It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.68,0:38:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.26,0:38:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要记住…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.47,0:38:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,永永远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to keep your sweet…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.89,0:38:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的小嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}…sweet mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.84,0:39:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.70,0:39:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鹅一号 执行代码3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosling One. Code 3 in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.95,0:39:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到一起违反禁宵令的举报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a curfew violation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.87,0:39:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 先生 请告诉我路在何方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Mister, won't you show the way? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.42,0:39:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我想要躲开 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Tryin' to get around ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.71,0:39:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只有一个理由让我活着 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Only one thought left Makes me come alive ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.38,0:39:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就是你我相依 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And that is you and me side by side ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.72,0:39:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 速度已经爆表 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ On the licorice ride ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.26,0:39:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 飞车党让我从梦里醒来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Motorbikes and leather men Take me to the edge of the dream ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.10,0:40:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 紧紧抱着你 就是这种感觉 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hold on tight Though, it sure feels right ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.48,0:40:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就这样紧紧抱着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Stick to you like a tie on a licorice ride ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.78,0:40:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.28,0:40:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小队参加三天的天使巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Main Force units, to three day Angel Patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.28,0:40:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来 大波普二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to have you back, Big Boppa Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.73,0:43:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地巡逻队 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}MFP, COPY.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.65,0:43:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地巡逻队 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}MFP, COPY.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.23,0:43:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿… 我是大鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey, it's the Goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.74,0:43:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你好运 路上出现的问题不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a lucky boy. Didn't even get road rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.25,0:43:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 密奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Midge…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.29,0:43:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没有看见我车毁人亡之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't write off the Goose…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.75,0:43:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别小看我大鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until you see the box going into the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.67,0:43:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 现在别撞坏我的卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well don't wreck my truck now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.92,0:44:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我明天开回来 - 不必急\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll bring it back tomorrow. - Yeah, no hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.27,0:44:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你还好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sure you're all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.26,0:44:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't be righter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.93,0:44:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米大鹅 活得生气盎然 只是丑毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy the Goose, larger than life and twice as ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.89,0:45:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我点火 强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light me, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.79,0:45:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,再点一根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light another.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.34,0:46:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.05,0:46:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是关键时刻 强尼 走过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the threshold moment, Johnny. Step through.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.53,0:46:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,斩脚趾 这不是我想要的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toecutter, this isn't what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.61,0:46:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去烧了它 烧了它 强尼 为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light it! Light it, Johnny, for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.97,0:46:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮条子 总是让你失去自尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bronze, they keep you from being proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.84,0:46:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他 他头上脚下 看起来是不是好呆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him. He looks silly, doesn't he, upside down?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.86,0:46:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了自由和夜骑士动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it for freedom and the Nightrider!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.82,0:46:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能 - 动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't! - Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.28,0:46:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 你这没用的垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - You scum-sucking trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.83,0:46:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.41,0:46:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.24,0:47:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max. Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.29,0:47:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.23,0:48:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 嗨…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max! Hey, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.40,0:48:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing in there…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.01,0:48:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是大鹅 绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that's not the Goose. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.00,0:49:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.88,0:49:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,花生酱和蜂蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peanut butter and honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.34,0:49:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直无法忘怀 洁西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't get it clear in my head, Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.15,0:49:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经是如此充满活力的小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so full of living, you know. He ran the franchise on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.53,0:49:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一切都不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.20,0:50:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在试着理解这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I am trying to put sense to it…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.56,0:50:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道这完全没道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when I know there isn't any.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我能忘怀的时就不会有事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be all right, once I get it clear in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.73,0:50:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有交通工具的修理 必须经过队长的授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}All vehicle repairs must be authorized by the Hall Captains.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.40,0:50:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,警员不准直接与地下机械师接洽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officers may not deal directly with underground mechanics.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.90,0:50:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做是犯法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing so is an offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.78,0:50:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,费费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fif.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.41,0:50:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,费费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fif.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.91,0:50:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛？- 我辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this? - I'm through.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.53,0:50:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又来了？- 不 不是又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again? - No, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.08,0:50:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不玩了 我辞职 - 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm through. I'm quitting. - Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.54,0:50:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是来讨论的 我来是告诉你 我要辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't come here to discuss it, I came to say it. I'm through.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.88,0:50:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一下子就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.26,0:50:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 大鹅死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the Goose bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.28,0:51:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这一向是他的生活态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's the way he always came at the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.89,0:51:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.26,0:51:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 很久以来 都没有出现一个大家都认可的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, you'd be the first to admit it was long overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.69,0:51:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我来告诉你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll tell you how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.65,0:51:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很厉害 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a winner, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.98,0:51:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the top shelf,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.80,0:51:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要因为想辞职的疯狂想法 而失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I won't lose you because of some crazy notion about quitting!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.86,0:51:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家说人们对英雄已不抱信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say that people don't believe in heroes anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.29,0:51:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, damn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.00,0:51:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, Max…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.54,0:51:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会让他们重新获得英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we're gonna give them back their heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.00,0:51:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老费 你真以为我信那套鬼扯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Fif, do you really expect me to go for that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.88,0:51:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须承认 我有一阵子听起来很吸引人吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta admit, I sounded good there for a minute, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.18,0:51:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 费费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Fifi.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.76,0:51:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你要我求你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, do you want me to beg?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.43,0:51:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我跪下来痛哭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me on my knees crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.64,0:51:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈 - 一下子就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ha, ha. - Now just a minute…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.64,0:51:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.32,0:51:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很害怕 老费 - 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm scared, Fif. - Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.94,0:52:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道原因吗？外界像是老鼠耍马戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why? It's that rat circus out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.36,0:52:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始乐在其中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm beginning to enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.78,0:52:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思 滑稽表演节？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, funny week?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.37,0:52:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果在公路上再呆下去 我就会成为他们其中一分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any longer out on that road, and I'm one of them, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.42,0:52:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个超级疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A terminal crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.58,0:52:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过我有警徽说我是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only, I've got a bronze badge to say I'm one of the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.79,0:52:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我想表达的意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.13,0:52:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你我要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you What I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.93,0:52:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,休假几星期怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off a few weeks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.72,0:52:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,长出满脸落腮胡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grow yourself a beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.06,0:52:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,懒散地招惹苍蝇 先考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw flies. Just think about it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.02,0:52:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你回来时依然有此意 我可以接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you still feel the same way when you come back, that's okay by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.48,0:52:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.40,0:52:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会改变心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.39,0:52:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我决定要跟着你一起辞职之前 快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here, before I decide to come with you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.58,0:52:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 老费 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Fif. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.71,0:52:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会回来的 洛卡谭斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be back, Rockatansky!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.96,0:52:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上瘾了 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hooked, Max…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.34,0:53:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.36,0:54:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来无法对你敞开心怀 洁西 聊我的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been able to say things to you, Jess. About how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.37,0:54:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直指望你会了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I always counted on you understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.71,0:54:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还小的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a kid…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.09,0:54:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和爸爸经常久久的散步\N{\fnArial\fs30}…me and my father used to go for long walks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.72,0:54:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得我爱盯着他的鞋看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember staring down at his shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.64,0:54:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是特制鞋 褐色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were special shoes. Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.77,0:54:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是把鞋擦得闪闪发亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he always kept them real shiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.78,0:54:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很高大 总是迈开大步走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was tall, and he used to take long strides.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.37,0:54:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我则在他身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there I'd be right alongside him…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.37,0:54:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着跟上他的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just trying to keep up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.38,0:55:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他从来不知道 我对他感到有多骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he ever knew how proud I felt of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.17,0:55:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是我能在他身边有多欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or how good it felt just to be there alongside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.14,0:55:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当我回想到那时 我依然觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even now, when I think back on it, I still feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.60,0:55:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是 洁西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, Jess…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.19,0:55:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时对他说不出口 但我现在能对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I couldn't tell him about it then, but I can tell you about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.78,0:55:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想等上十年才告诉你 我现在对你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna wait 10 years to tell you how I'm feeling about you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.27,0:56:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.81,0:56:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看一下 - 我们刚刚车子爆胎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get a load of that! - We had a blowout a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.62,0:56:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,严重 非常严重 引擎还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raunchy, very raunchy. ls the motor okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.28,0:56:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 引擎还好 至于这个轮胎…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the motor's fine. Look, about this tire…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.95,0:56:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己不常修这种状况 除了从路上清除它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do much work on these myself, except to scrape them off the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.58,0:56:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 看看这轮胎怎么了？- 马上解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Hey, how about this tire, huh? - Have it fixed in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.11,0:56:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卖一组登禄普给你 便宜到不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sell you a set of Dunlops for next to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.61,0:56:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不必 谢了 - 我不记得我怎么拿到那些货的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, thanks. - I can't remember where I got them…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.25,0:56:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是拿到了 懂我的意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I got them, know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.80,0:56:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你只要帮我把这个轮胎修好就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we'll be all right just as soon as we get this fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.34,0:56:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克斯 - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Max? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.43,0:56:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.39,0:56:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小不点让我买冰淇淋给他吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Sproggo's talked me into buying him an ice cream, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.02,0:56:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们待会儿见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.85,0:56:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 海滩附近有间店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, there's a shop just down the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.98,0:56:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会非常感激你们的光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll appreciate the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.88,0:56:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.07,0:56:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,草莓冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toodle pip.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.32,0:56:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.33,0:57:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车出来兜风？这是开车到处走的好时节\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just trucking around? Good time for just trucking.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.21,0:57:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望我能自己去兜风 你们往哪里走？往北？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I could do a bit myself. Which way you heading? North?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.44,0:57:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.91,0:57:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我发现了什么好吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what's turned up for Sunday dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.29,0:57:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,主菜加甜点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Main course and dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.59,0:57:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite kind…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.17,0:57:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…female.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.54,0:58:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.13,0:58:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心他的舌头 亲爱的 我看过他把 自己眉毛舔干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the tongue, sweetheart. I've seen him lick his eyebrow clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.83,0:59:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定花了不少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must've spent some loot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.96,0:59:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那句名言 速度快慢只是钱多钱少的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the sign says, speed's just a question of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.59,0:59:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想开到多快？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fast do you wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.72,0:59:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克斯 快上车 - 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Max, quick, get in. - What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.63,0:59:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的就是 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take my word for it, get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.55,0:59:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 轮胎怎么办？- 拜托 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the tire? - Please, Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.68,0:59:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 轮胎 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tire, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.02,0:59:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 大哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fella!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.65,0:59:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your tire!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.69,0:59:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人真疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy people!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.69,0:59:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界到处都是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's full of crazy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.55,0:59:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆旅行车 来过这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wagon, was it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.59,1:00:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 带着小孩的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, a couple with a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.17,1:00:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是谁？- 我还帮他们补了轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are they? - I was just fixing their tire.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.68,1:00:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不要轮胎就跑了 那也不算太差\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left their goddamn spare. Not a bad one either.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.35,1:00:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是谁？- 一对夫妻…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are they? - A couple…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.98,1:00:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过这里 说向北边走吧 也许是北边\N{\fnArial\fs30}…passing through. Said they were heading north. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.41,1:00:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要开车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to drive the car? No?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.45,1:00:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能开了 到后面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd rather play with the ball? Into the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.89,1:00:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 坐过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.72,1:00:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在还清楚的记得那张脸 那表情看起来象刚吞掉一块砖头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still see his face now. Looked as if he'd just swallowed a brick.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.55,1:00:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是刻簿的老女人 对吧 老大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a mean old lady you are. Huh, Sproggy?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.72,1:00:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说够了 老兄 - 我们的狗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's enough from you, mate! - The dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.60,1:00:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.36,1:00:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got there, pal?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.65,1:01:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.03,1:01:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, that's the way I see it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.12,1:01:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 啊哈 唔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Uh-huh. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.29,1:01:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 当然 很高兴跟你谈 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. It's been nice talking to you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.04,1:01:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你同意他的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it you agreed with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.63,1:01:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们不担心 我就不担心 - 至于那个呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If they're not worried, I'm not. - What about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.43,1:01:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那是遣失物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure it's lost property.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.18,1:01:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如没人认领 我建议忘了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If no one makes a claim to it, I say we can forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.43,1:01:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得还不错 洁西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds okay to me, Jess.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.60,1:01:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.19,1:01:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果齐基也这样说 相信我 不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Ziggy says so, believe me, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.98,1:01:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 阿梅还在农场里等这你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, May's expecting you up at the farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.81,1:01:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里什么烦恼都会被一扫而空 只有绿绿的青草和肥肥的奶牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have no more trouble up there. Just green grass and fat cows.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.69,1:02:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 修得怎样？- 快完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you doing? - Mm. I'm getting there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.05,1:02:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你应该把那小玩意 连接到那装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reckon you ought to connect the doohickey to the gizmo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.20,1:02:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.96,1:02:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢用那双脏手碰我 我就把你分尸 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You touch me with those hands and I'll rip you apart. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.33,1:02:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 看看它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, look at them!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.89,1:02:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 告诉我 我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No! - You gonna give me a hug?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.46,1:02:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.40,1:03:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿梅跟我说在树丛附近有片小海滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}May told me about the little beach down by the trees.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 你想不想来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm. - Do you want to come?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.43,1:03:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love to…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.95,1:03:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我得修好风扇皮带 否则我们永远走不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…except that I've gotta fix the fan belt, or we're never gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.12,1:03:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 泰山 我去给你拿些香蕉来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Tarzan, I'll bring you back some bananas.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.15,1:03:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.26,1:03:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.57,1:03:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,洁西 如果你在那里遇到班诺 别理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessie. If you meet Benno down there, don't let him bother you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.98,1:03:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's only a baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.96,1:03:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 阿梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, May.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.49,1:04:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.88,1:07:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,洁西 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessie, Jessie, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.31,1:07:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 告诉我是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, now, and tell me what's the matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.43,1:07:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常 非常幼稚的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very, very naughty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.57,1:07:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你告诉我阿梅… - 阿梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now you tell May what you… - May.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.36,1:08:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿梅 你打给齐基\N{\fnArial\fs30}May, you go and call Ziggy. Call Ziggy…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.24,1:08:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说尽快赶过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and tell him to get here as fast as he can.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.87,1:08:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.56,1:08:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们遏到一点帮派麻烦 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've got some biker trouble. It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.31,1:08:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 亲爱的 来 洁西 我们进屋里 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, darling. Come on, Jessie. Well, let's go into the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.05,1:08:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be all right. It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.22,1:08:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过得很不顺心 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had an awful time, darling…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.32,1:08:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.44,1:08:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.95,1:08:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是去打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just got to go and make a phone call…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.91,1:08:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们好好喝杯热茶怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then we'll have a nice hot cup of tea, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.45,1:09:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我接齐基 快点好不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me Ziggy, and hurry it up, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.02,1:09:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿梅史维西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's May Swaisey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.89,1:09:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小不点 喔 糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sprog? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.12,1:09:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小不点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sprog?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.92,1:09:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sprog!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.80,1:09:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sprog!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.35,1:09:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sprog!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.73,1:10:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sprog!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.19,1:10:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.99,1:10:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的年轻妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our little mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.04,1:10:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人是康迪里尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there is Cundalini…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.86,1:10:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,康迫里尼想要拿回他的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Cundalini wants his hand back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.71,1:10:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要我的宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I want my baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.09,1:10:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.83,1:10:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'll swap you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.28,1:10:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 把我的宝宝还我 - 洁西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, give me my baby. - Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.02,1:10:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,洁西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessie, Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.83,1:10:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是一点幽默感也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've not got a sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.53,1:10:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你有一张漂亮的脸蛋儿 非常的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a pretty face, though, awful pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.82,1:10:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮的要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, awful pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.63,1:10:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你长了漂亮脸蛋 不需要幽默感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you don't need a sense of humor with a pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.46,1:10:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过唯一的问题 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only trouble is though, missy…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.06,1:10:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you should…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.13,1:11:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去了那张脸蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}…lose the face…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.88,1:11:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别伤害我的宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't hurt my baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.62,1:11:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就一无所有 - 你想要我怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …you've got nothing! - What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.76,1:11:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别改变话题 - 不准动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't change the subject. - Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.68,1:11:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停在原地 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right there! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.60,1:11:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我讨厌枪 - 老婆婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hate guns. - Old lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.56,1:11:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.19,1:11:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不准靠近 - 女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay back! - Woman!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.46,1:11:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.57,1:11:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁胆敢动一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone so much as breathes…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.61,1:11:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我轰烂他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'll cream them!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.57,1:11:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.33,1:11:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.22,1:11:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,将宝宝放在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the baby on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.26,1:11:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,洁西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessie!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.05,1:11:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the van.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.42,1:12:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有扇门 - 不要停 直接冲过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gate! - Don't stop. Just go right through.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.12,1:12:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.50,1:13:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马达 - 你想说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The motor! - What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.00,1:13:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 它熄火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, it just died on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.88,1:13:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.16,1:13:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.22,1:14:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 洁西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jessie!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.30,1:14:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.19,1:14:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.06,1:14:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.50,1:14:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是医生 不是算命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a doctor, not a fortuneteller.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.40,1:14:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,内伤很严重？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This your subdural?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.59,1:14:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 没办法 - 是不是有太多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, that's her. - Lot of problems, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.10,1:15:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,多处创伤 脾 肝 肺 连枷胸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Multiple traumas, spleen, liver, lung, flail chest…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.76,1:15:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,左股骨颈 肾功能衰竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}…left neck of femur, renal shutdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.62,1:15:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像购物清单 她还救得回来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reads like a grocery list. She salvageable?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.18,1:15:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 她昨晚总算是恢复一些知觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure, we got all her signs back last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.17,1:15:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲属？- 她丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relatives? - The husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.13,1:15:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还有个孩子 不过在送到这里之前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lost the kid. DOA.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.66,1:15:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 跟他说她会没事 要他别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, tell him she's going to be all right. Tell him not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.58,1:15:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他需要 我可以跟他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wants, I'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.35,1:15:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他不希望跟任何人谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he wants to talk to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.97,1:15:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他整天像僵尸般站在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been standing there like a zombie all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.21,1:16:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布巴赞内提 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bubba Zanetti, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.21,1:16:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想来骑车发泄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come for the scooter?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.84,1:16:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要到今天下午才会好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't be ready until this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.30,1:16:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,修前叉时还是遇到了点麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still having trouble with the front forks.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.88,1:16:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,整修它们麻烦死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're mothers to work with.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.26,1:16:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.13,1:16:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋 你以为你在搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asshole! What the molly frock do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.99,1:16:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和你谈谈斩脚趾的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me are gonna talk about the Toecutter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.20,1:16:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没听说过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of him. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.67,1:16:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃错什么药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the Christ?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.44,1:16:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想了解那刺青\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know about the Toecutter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.53,1:17:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只关心自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mind my own business, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.63,1:17:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他们会杀掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they'd kill me if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.56,1:17:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说出名字 你只要回答是或不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll say the names and you say "yes" or "no."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.59,1:17:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夜骑士 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nightrider. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.64,1:17:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斩脚趾 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Toecutter. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.97,1:17:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布巴赞内提 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bubba Zanetti. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.04,1:17:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更多人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.18,1:17:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 强尼 - 强尼小子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They took Johnny. - Johnny the Boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.35,1:17:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 还有其他人 - 在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Some others. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.07,1:17:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海滩那里 寻找燃油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out at the beaches, looking for fuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.32,1:17:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会回来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they coming back?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.88,1:17:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.29,1:17:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们骑着摩托车到处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got their bikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.80,1:17:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的我真的就不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.63,1:22:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在查询一辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locate black Pursuit Special.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.05,1:22:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色追缉专用车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unauthorized use by a Main Force officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.77,1:23:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再玩了 布巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit toying, Bubba.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.94,1:23:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松点 我知道自己在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.42,1:27:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.27,1:27:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man. This…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.55,1:27:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不像你看到的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't what it looks, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.39,1:27:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I… I just came down here to check it out, and…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.08,1:27:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人已经翘辫子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this guy has already been snuffed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.81,1:27:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救不回他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing you could do for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.35,1:27:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚踝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ankle.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.35,1:28:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.99,1:28:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛 老兄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.87,1:28:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心我的脚踝 我的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, my ankle! My foot, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.53,1:28:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我跟那里发生的事 一点关系也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, I had nothing to do with anything going on back there, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.33,1:28:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听一下行不行？听我说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, man, will you? Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.21,1:28:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 他们是一帮不要命的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you listen to me? They were a hell of a crazy people back there, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.03,1:28:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很坏的人 我跟那一切没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of bad people. I'm not responsible for anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.22,1:28:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.12,1:28:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.47,1:28:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？你想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.80,1:28:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, I'm not a bad man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.14,1:28:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生病了 看到没？我生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick, see? Sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.33,1:28:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫什么病来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.16,1:28:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神病 人格分裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychopathic, you know. Personality disorder.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.12,1:28:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,法官是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The judge, man, he said so.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.12,1:29:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会伤害我吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna hurt me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.98,1:29:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你不能杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! You can't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.09,1:29:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能因为偷别人靴子就杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for stealing a man's boots!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.03,1:29:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经死了 老天帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was dead, for chrissakes!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.06,1:29:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不需要靴子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't need them anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.90,1:29:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.77,1:29:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道你要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.94,1:29:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,手铐用的链子 是用高强度钢制造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chain in those handcuffs is high-tensile steel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.16,1:29:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要十分钟才能用它锯断\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd take you 1O minutes to hack through it with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.62,1:29:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 假如你运气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you're lucky…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.20,1:29:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能在五分钟内锯断脚踝 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you could hack through your ankle in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.76,1:29:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mad, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.05,1:29:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我看来很傻是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I look silly, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.51,1:29:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用这套对付我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bring this on me, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.72,1:30:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托别这样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.99,1:30:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天救命 我是个病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sweet Jesus. I was sick!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.28,1:30:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托别这样惩罚我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bring this on me, please!
